# Cursor IDE Entrypoint

Before executing any task or generating code, Cursor must strictly follow the initialization protocol:
1. Read constraints: `.skills/contraint.md`
2. Read target architecture: `.skills/target.md` (execute Project Auto-Discovery Protocol)
3. Scan skill index: `skills/llms.txt` and load corresponding `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`
4. Refer to `AGENTS.md` for core routing rules.
